OL,3,GNEWSAThird person charged over stabbing
OL,4,Adeath
OL,5,
OL,6,FA third person has been charged in
OL,7,Fconnection with the fatal stabbing of a
OL,8,Ffather of three in Manchester, police
OL,9,Fsaid.
OL,11,FAdrian Brown, 34, died in hospital
OL,12,Fafter being found with stab wounds to
OL,13,Fthe chest on Raby Street in Moss Side
OL,14,Fon 8 May.
OL,16,FEmeil Lee, 26, currently of HMP Forest
OL,17,FBank, has been charged with murder as
OL,18,Fpart of the investigation into Brown's
OL,19,Fdeath. He is due to appear before
OL,20,FManchester and Salford Magistrates'
OL,21,FCourt on Monday.
OL,23,APub: 06-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
